   "id": 631850,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>What are the <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>-values of the <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>-intercept(s) of&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y=(x-9)(x+2)\">y=(x-9)(x+2)</span>?</p>",
